/**
 * Article grid + Load more — Figma node 12289:26928.
 *
 * This section owns both the data and the filtering behaviour. The controls it
 * reads live in `Filters.astro`, a separate Embed, so the script binds its
 * listeners on `document` instead of on the form: delegation makes the wiring
 * independent of which Embed Webflow renders first, and of whether the filter
 * bar is present at all.
 *
 * `topic` / `country` must match the option lists in `Filters.astro`.
 * `image: ''` falls back to the Figma "Visual Placeholder" tint.
